WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:05,880
Commander Zhuang, you have something to do with me?

2
00:00:05,880 --> 00:00:09,740
I know you picked up the gun before

3
00:00:09,740 --> 00:00:10,940
There aren't many bullets left in it

4
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:11,940
You keep these

5
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,340
Is this a controlled product?

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,140
You won't be punished by me, no

7
00:00:15,140 --> 00:00:16,340
The situation is special now

8
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:17,340
You are a girl

9
00:00:17,340 --> 00:00:18,340
Stay for self-defense

10
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:22,380
How do you know I live in 1502

11
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,980
Recruited by the two people who were captured last time

12
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,380
They've been targeting you for a long time

13
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:26,770
wait a moment

14
00:00:26,770 --> 00:00:33,380
Keep these for yourself

15
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,580
I collected all the bullets

16
00:00:34,580 --> 00:00:37,380
If you take this, I can't do anything. It's really going to happen.

17
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:38,580
Go to Shen'ai Hospital to find me

18
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,580
Bullets collected

19
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,580
The return gift was not sent out

20
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,820
This debt of gratitude is even more difficult to repay.

21
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:56,020
Corn and cereals grow so quickly

22
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,820
Corn peeling and drying

23
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,820
Dried corn is concentrated alone as fuel
